            </note>
            <note corresp="#d849-f4" n="2" xml:id="d849-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram 64, from Panama City, July 29, 1951, Ambassador John C. Wiley, who
                    had been appointed Ambassador on June 20 and had arrived in Panama on July 17,
                    stated in part that he would “endeavor promptly obtain broadening of decree in
                    line with Deptel 48 July 26”.
                    (919.537/7–2951)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
